sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Settings
  participant Registry
  participant Consent
  participant Module
  participant Provider
  User->>Settings: Enable Google Drive
  Settings->>Registry: Read manifest and permissions
  Registry-->>Settings: Provider, scopes, purpose, data flow
  Settings->>Consent: Explicit approval
  Consent->>Registry: Persist local consent record
  Registry->>Module: Dynamic import
  Module->>Provider: User-initiated OAuth PKCE
  Provider-->>Module: Transient token
